1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,001
.

2
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:13,560
Why did we come here for coffee?

3
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,560
Look how nice it is here.

4
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:18,000
It's the perfect spot to have coffee.

5
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,159
Don't give me that.

6
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,319
Tian Xin owns this cafe, doesn't she?

7
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,159
You're here for Li Xiao again.

8
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,080
Truth is...

9
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,759
Li Xiao staying in Yangchuan to work the case

10
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,400
wasn't just to catch Huang Weiguang.

11
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:36,879
There's another reason.

12
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,360
He didn't want to return to this painful place.

13
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,680
Look at you.

14
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:43,639
You understand men better than you do women.

15
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,000
Do I?

16
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:46,960
Yes, you do.

17
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:50,680
Whatever.

18
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:53,000
Do whatever you want.

19
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:55,120
Are you sure if we just walk in like this,

20
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:58,280
we won't be meddling and complicating things?

21
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,199
We'll play it by ear.

22
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:05,000
When it comes to romance, you're the expert.

23
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:05,879
I'll follow your lead.

24
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,759
Let's go.

25
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:19,560
You're suspected of major drug trafficking.

26
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,599
Here's your coffee.

27
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,159
What are you guys doing here?

28
00:03:49,319 --> 00:03:50,000
Enjoy, you two.

29
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,120
Wait a second.

30
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,639
Can we talk for a minute?

31
00:03:55,759 --> 00:03:57,080
Sorry, I have guests today.

32
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,080
It'll only take a few minutes.

33
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,560
Say more good things about Li Xiao to her.

34
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,480
Tian Xin,

35
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,079
you know that

36
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,199
Li Xiao truly cares about you.

37
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,399
He told us

38
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,720
he feels being with him

39
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,879
doesn't make you feel secure.

40
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,959
But you must know,

41
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,439
when it comes to your relationship,

42
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,040
his heart is truly in it.

43
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:46,680
I've never doubted his feelings for me.

44
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,439
It's...

45
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:51,560
It's myself that I'm doubting.

46
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:54,959
I'm scared that one day he'll just disappear.

47
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,439
I don't know what I'd do then.

48
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,399
I don't want him to focus only on work,

49
00:05:03,639 --> 00:05:04,680
neglecting the people around him,

50
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,879
even those who love him.

51
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,360
They say whoever you fall in love with,

52
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:14,360
you have to accept their way of life.

53
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,600
I think you two just

54
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,480
lack communication and understanding.

55
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,959
Last time you were in danger,

56
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:24,480
he rushed to you, worried sick.

57
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:25,199
But he didn't

58
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,759
show up when I needed him most.

59
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,720
What I care about

60
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:37,759
isn't just that.

61
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:44,040
I've tried so hard to adapt to all this,

62
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:49,279
but I just can't accept

63
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,240
that he's a police officer.

64
00:06:10,759 --> 00:06:12,240
Li Xiao hasn't been doing well lately.

65
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:14,480
Find some time

66
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,160
to give him a call.

67
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:18,439
Consider it a favor to me.

68
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,480
I know

69
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:40,000
you've refused to give up your supplier

70
00:06:40,439 --> 00:06:41,519
to protect your family.

71
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:45,639
But of the three who took your family,

72
00:06:47,759 --> 00:06:49,240
one has already been arrested,

73
00:06:49,839 --> 00:06:51,959
and the other two were killed on the scene.

74
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,399
By now, you should realize

75
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,560
the only ones who can protect your family

76
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,240
are the police,

77
00:06:58,519 --> 00:06:59,680
the forces of justice.

78
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,480
Qian Feng,

79
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,399
we already have substantial leads

80
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,439
on the Nanhai drug cartel.

81
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:08,959
Whether you talk or not,

82
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:10,759
we will get to the bottom of this.

83
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,800
But if our findings point right to

84
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,720
the criminals you're covering for,

85
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:16,680
won't that cartel think

86
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,879
you were the one who ratted them out?

87
00:07:18,879 --> 00:07:20,399
Then the threat you're afraid of

88
00:07:20,639 --> 00:07:21,519
will still happen.

89
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,319
You have only one way out now:

90
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,079
cooperate with our investigation

91
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,800
and bring those criminals to justice.

92
00:07:27,959 --> 00:07:30,279
Only then can your family

93
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:31,120
live a normal life.

94
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:36,040
But I have to make one thing clear.

95
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:39,079
Even if you confess everything now,

96
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,560
we may not be able

97
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,639
to get you a lighter sentence,

98
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,639
because the crimes you committed

99
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,680
are truly heinous.

100
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:16,600
There's one more thing

101
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,800
I want to tell you.

102
00:08:19,279 --> 00:08:21,199
Lately, your daughter's been asking me

103
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,839
if her dad has righted his wrongs.

104
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,399
I've never answered her,

105
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,759
because every time I look at her,

106
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,639
in her eyes,

107
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,600
I see sadness,

108
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,120
and even shame.

109
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:36,759
As a mother,

110
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,000
I just can't bring myself to face her.

111
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,480
If I were you,

112
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,919
I would show her through my actions

113
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,720
that everyone makes mistakes,

114
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:53,000
but she has a dad

115
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,759
who's willing to turn his life around.

116
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:09,200
Wait.

117
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,000
I hope...

118
00:09:12,279 --> 00:09:14,480
before the court hands down my sentence,

119
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:16,519
I can see my daughter one last time.

120
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,120
I'll arrange it for you.

121
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:22,960
It's my final wish.

122
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,159
Do you think what we did today

123
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:50,480
was meddling a bit too much?

124
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:54,080
Anyway, we said what needed to be said.

125
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,840
We were helping him out.

126
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:58,720
But we didn't really help him at all.

127
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,799
And you know how proud Li Xiao is.

128
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:03,840
If he finds out we helped behind his back,

129
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:05,600
will he hold it against us?

130
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,320
No, he won't.

131
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,399
Actually, Tian Xin already has her answer.

132
00:11:10,559 --> 00:11:12,240
On my way, on my way! Almost there!

133
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:26,879
Have you eaten?

134
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,240
Yes.

135
00:11:30,159 --> 00:11:31,440
Why are you eating instant noodles again?

136
00:11:32,559 --> 00:11:33,639
Why didn't you join Huanhuan

137
00:11:33,639 --> 00:11:34,720
for dinner at her grandpa's?

138
00:11:34,919 --> 00:11:36,679
I got off work late and missed dinner.

139
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,399
Still, that's way too simple for dinner.

140
00:11:39,879 --> 00:11:41,519
That's hardly fair to our brilliant Mr. He.

141
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,519
I'd love to have a proper meal,

142
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:44,679
if only someone would cook at home.

143
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,120
Use your phone.

144
00:11:46,679 --> 00:11:48,039
Order takeout on your phone.

145
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,039
What do you want to eat?

146
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:50,039
Here, let me order for you.

147
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:52,600
Like I can't order myself?

148
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,320
If I liked that stuff,

149
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,320
would I be eating instant noodles?

150
00:11:58,039 --> 00:11:59,080
So you just love instant noodles.

151
00:12:00,279 --> 00:12:00,720
Got it.

152
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:09,919
Whether I like it or not, I'm used to it.

153
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,159
But you have a daughter.

154
00:12:11,159 --> 00:12:12,080
She's six years old now.

155
00:12:12,639 --> 00:12:13,440
In all the years she's grown,

156
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,159
how many meals have you ever cooked for her?

157
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,919
You say my meal isn't proper enough,

158
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:20,399
so why don't you make a simple meal for us?

159
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:27,679
Work has been really busy lately.

160
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:29,759
We're linking and cracking three cases,

161
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,399
so the team is under a lot of pressure.

162
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,879
Everyone is giving it their all.

163
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,279
As the captain,

164
00:12:34,279 --> 00:12:35,600
shouldn't I set an example?

165
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:37,120
You should support me on this.

166
00:12:37,399 --> 00:12:37,840
Support you?

167
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:40,159
Haven't I been supporting you all along?

168
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,879
Can't you, just once in a while,

169
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:47,399
get off work on time?

170
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,639
Haven't I done that?

171
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,519
Have you?

172
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:52,759
Forget it.

173
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,519
Bai Hua, let me ask you something.

174
00:12:56,519 --> 00:12:58,039
If you really don't see this as home,

175
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,639
why don't you just move to the precinct?

176
00:12:59,919 --> 00:13:00,759
It'd make working easier anyway.

177
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,240
That cuts deep.

178
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,759
I do have a family.

179
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:05,879
Oh, so you do know.

180
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:12,279
You knew what I did before we got married.

181
00:13:12,799 --> 00:13:14,000
Back then, you said

182
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,240
marrying a city guardian as your wife

183
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:18,000
made you feel proud and honored.

184
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:20,840
Why has your tune completely changed now?

185
00:13:21,159 --> 00:13:22,960
Because you're not just my wife now,

186
00:13:23,159 --> 00:13:24,240
you're also Huanhuan's mother.

187
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,840
If you really can't fulfill

188
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:26,799
the duties of a mother,

189
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,519
maybe the two of us should just...

190
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:29,639
Just what?

191
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:30,399
Make yourself clear.

192
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:45,960
Huanhuan just lay down.

193
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,399
Why don't you go say good night to her?

194
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:52,879
Copy that.

195
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,240
Huanhuan.

196
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,080
Captain Bai.

197
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,279
Why aren't you asleep yet?

198
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,000
I can't sleep.

199
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,399
I want you to tell me a story.

200
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:18,360
Okay. Mom will tell you a story, alright?

201
00:14:20,039 --> 00:14:21,000
What do you want to hear?

202
00:14:21,879 --> 00:14:22,559
Let's see...

203
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:30,879
"The Little Field Mouse's Overalls."

204
00:14:32,159 --> 00:14:35,320
The little field mouse went out in his overalls.

205
00:14:35,919 --> 00:14:37,320
He said to his friends,

206
00:14:37,879 --> 00:14:40,919
"Do you like the overalls Mom made for me?"

207
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:43,679
A hare walked over,

208
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:46,720
tugged at the little mouse's overalls, and said,

209
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,240
"Your overalls look so nice."

210
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:52,080
Captain Bai, you won't divorce Dad, will you?

211
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:55,879
Of course not.

212
00:14:56,759 --> 00:14:58,039
Why would you think that?

213
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:04,039
I've often heard you and Dad fighting at night lately.

214
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,519
I'm scared.

215
00:15:09,399 --> 00:15:11,039
Dad and Mom are doing just fine.

216
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:13,799
Don't worry, and don't overthink it, okay?

217
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:17,360
Mom will tell you a story.

218
00:15:18,799 --> 00:15:19,840
Captain Bai, this story...

219
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:24,399
I've already heard it so many times.

220
00:15:25,919 --> 00:15:27,720
Then what do you want to hear? Mom will tell you.

221
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:31,519
I want to hear about cops catching bad guys.

222
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:32,639
Okay.

223
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:35,840
Mom will tell you a story about cops catching bad guys.

224
00:15:38,639 --> 00:15:39,480
Captain Bai...

225
00:15:39,679 --> 00:15:44,799
I want you to catch all the bad guys soon.

226
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,240
That way you can come home earlier

227
00:15:46,679 --> 00:15:49,399
after work to spend time with me.

228
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,000
Mom is working hard on it.

229
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:56,799
Good girl.

230
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,720
Due to Indian enterprises

231
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,879
squeezing our Southeast Asian market,

232
00:16:59,519 --> 00:17:00,840
the company's performance this year

233
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,559
not only failed to keep pace with

234
00:17:03,639 --> 00:17:05,119
the growth of the past two years,

235
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,799
but actually dropped by five percent.

236
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:11,279
And looking at last quarter's accounts,

237
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,559
the company has already started losing money.

238
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,039
Mr. Jiang.

239
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:19,480
Ah, all the executives are here.

240
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:23,440
This was an emergency meeting;

241
00:17:23,799 --> 00:17:25,079
we didn't have time to notify you yet.

242
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:26,599
Mr. Chen.

243
00:17:26,799 --> 00:17:27,400
Please, have a seat.

244
00:17:28,039 --> 00:17:28,400
All right.

245
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:32,079
The thing is,

246
00:17:32,559 --> 00:17:35,400
given how fierce global competition has become,

247
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,160
we'd like to...

248
00:17:36,759 --> 00:17:38,279
transfer you to the marketing department,

249
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:40,599
as Director of Overseas Marketing.

250
00:17:41,319 --> 00:17:42,680
As for the finance department,

251
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:46,039
the company has decided to assign someone else.

252
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:52,039
Miss Gu? Please come in.

253
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:53,960
Mr. Jiang.

254
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:54,640
Right now, I—

255
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:56,200
You've been with Longze Group for so long,

256
00:17:56,279 --> 00:17:58,960
and you know every aspect of the company.

257
00:17:59,039 --> 00:18:00,599
Putting you in charge of overseas operations,

258
00:18:01,039 --> 00:18:02,359
we all feel completely at ease.

259
00:18:08,319 --> 00:18:08,720
Mr. Jiang...

260
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:11,039
Let me introduce everyone.

261
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:14,759
Returning from her studies in Europe,

262
00:18:14,759 --> 00:18:15,680
this is Miss Gu Xiaoyi.

263
00:18:15,799 --> 00:18:18,359
Starting today, she will succeed Mr. Chen

264
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,519
as our Chief Financial Officer.

265
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,119
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

266
00:18:24,279 --> 00:18:25,279
I'm new to the company,

267
00:18:25,519 --> 00:18:27,440
so I'll have a lot to learn from everyone.

268
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,200
Please have a seat.

269
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:34,480
Mr. Jiang.

270
00:18:35,119 --> 00:18:36,440
The company's CFO

271
00:18:36,839 --> 00:18:39,079
has always been appointed by the Chairman personally.

272
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,680
Miss Gu was recruited by the Chairman himself, too.

273
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:45,200
You know how the Chairman works,

274
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,599
don't you?

275
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,960
I only received a call

276
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,480
from the Chairman yesterday myself.

277
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,720
If a majority of the shareholders here

278
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:55,160
are opposed to it,

279
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:56,640
I'll suggest to the Chairman

280
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,599
that he reconsider this matter.

281
00:18:58,599 --> 00:18:59,119
That won't be necessary.

282
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:02,119
Chairman Long informed us long ago.

283
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:03,680
Mr. Chen.

284
00:19:04,599 --> 00:19:05,960
Your hard work and dedication

285
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:08,319
are obvious to all of us.

286
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:11,559
But the company's accounts these past few months

287
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:12,880
have indeed been rather messy.

288
00:19:13,279 --> 00:19:16,000
Miss Gu is a top graduate in finance

289
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,079
from Columbia University.

290
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,400
Having her take charge of the books,

291
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,440
we can rest easy as well.

292
00:19:22,119 --> 00:19:22,799
All right, then.

293
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,079
Then it's settled.

294
00:19:24,559 --> 00:19:27,240
Miss Gu officially assumes office today.

295
00:19:33,319 --> 00:19:35,680
Director Zhou Xianyang from the Provincial Department called today.

296
00:19:35,799 --> 00:19:38,079
He wants us to send an officer

297
00:19:38,079 --> 00:19:39,559
to take part in a joint operation

298
00:19:39,559 --> 00:19:41,559
coordinated with Interpol.

299
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,440
Why us?

300
00:19:45,119 --> 00:19:47,200
Our old rival, the drug lord Ma Jingrong,

301
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,359
has surfaced abroad.

302
00:19:48,599 --> 00:19:49,359
An undercover operation?

303
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:50,240
Yes.

304
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,000
Our officer will be sent abroad

305
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:55,079
to infiltrate Ma Jingrong's inner circle,

306
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:57,200
bide time to gather evidence of his crimes,

307
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,400
and then bring him in.

308
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:01,000
This mission is extremely dangerous,

309
00:20:01,359 --> 00:20:03,960
so the candidate must be chosen with great care.

310
00:20:06,079 --> 00:20:07,400
If you have anyone in mind,

311
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,279
let me hear your recommendations.

312
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,160
Director Huang,

313
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:12,759
I volunteer for this mission.

314
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:13,480
I disagree.

315
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:15,720
You're the deputy captain of the narcotics squad.

316
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:18,160
Many operations require you to co-command.

317
00:20:18,559 --> 00:20:19,319
Captain Bai, I...

318
00:20:19,319 --> 00:20:20,319
I need you here.

319
00:20:23,559 --> 00:20:24,559
Then let me recommend someone.

320
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:27,519
I think Li Xiao is up to it.

321
00:20:27,680 --> 00:20:29,920
Li Xiao is sharp and versatile,

322
00:20:30,039 --> 00:20:31,160
and quite experienced.

323
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:34,039
I believe he can pull off this mission.

324
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:39,200
I acknowledge Li Xiao's abilities,

325
00:20:39,559 --> 00:20:40,480
but there are two points

326
00:20:40,759 --> 00:20:42,039
I'd like you to consider.

327
00:20:43,519 --> 00:20:45,400
First, Li Xiao completed the mission

328
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:47,880
to capture Huang Weiguang in Yangchuan

329
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:48,880
and hasn't returned to base yet.

330
00:20:49,559 --> 00:20:51,960
Second, undercover work is high-stakes,

331
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:53,759
and operating abroad this time

332
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:57,559
will be harder than we can ever imagine.

333
00:20:58,640 --> 00:20:59,279
Furthermore,

334
00:20:59,839 --> 00:21:01,160
we've lost comrades before

335
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,079
during undercover operations

336
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:05,559
due to emotional issues.

337
00:21:05,559 --> 00:21:06,319
As for Li Xiao,

338
00:21:07,559 --> 00:21:09,160
his emotional state hasn't been stable.

339
00:21:09,319 --> 00:21:11,680
I'm worried his emotions might cloud his judgment.

340
00:21:11,759 --> 00:21:13,480
If that happens,

341
00:21:14,119 --> 00:21:15,039
and our rescue operation

342
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:17,160
can't be deployed in time,

343
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,119
the outcome

344
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,119
is something none of us wants to see.

345
00:21:26,319 --> 00:21:27,880
Then do you have someone else in mind?

346
00:21:31,319 --> 00:21:33,079
If we have to send someone,

347
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:36,640
I recommend Zhuang Yan.

348
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:37,559
Zhuang Yan?

349
00:21:41,079 --> 00:21:42,799
Of course, we must respect his willingness.

350
00:21:43,839 --> 00:21:45,839
If Zhuang Yan goes undercover abroad,

351
00:21:47,079 --> 00:21:48,680
who will serve as his handler?

352
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:50,480
That hasn't been decided yet.

353
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,519
If that's the case,

354
00:21:56,839 --> 00:21:57,680
then I recommend Ge Dan.

355
00:21:58,599 --> 00:22:00,359
First, they're both fresh faces.

356
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:03,079
Second, they were classmates in the police academy.

357
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:04,799
They'll have great chemistry.

358
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:08,079
Ge Dan lacks experience, after all.

359
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:12,119
When playing a role, a lack of experience

360
00:22:14,119 --> 00:22:15,440
isn't necessarily a bad thing.

361
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:29,039
This whole area...

362
00:22:29,039 --> 00:22:30,359
is where I lived as a kid.

363
00:22:30,519 --> 00:22:32,759
But it's completely different now.

364
00:22:34,279 --> 00:22:34,880
Look over there.

365
00:22:35,559 --> 00:22:36,559
There used to be a courtyard,

366
00:22:36,559 --> 00:22:37,240
with an old locust tree beside it.

367
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:38,960
Back then, the neighborhood kids...

368
00:22:39,240 --> 00:22:40,880
would always climb that locust tree to play.

369
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:42,759
Under that tree,

370
00:22:42,759 --> 00:22:44,480
an old dog named A'Huang would always sit.

371
00:22:45,119 --> 00:22:47,559
Every day, that old dog would lie under that tree.

372
00:22:48,200 --> 00:22:49,480
Didn't know you were so nostalgic.

373
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,720
Everyone is like that, really.

374
00:22:53,519 --> 00:22:54,559
Everyone's childhood...

375
00:22:55,519 --> 00:22:57,720
is both distant and vivid.

376
00:22:58,519 --> 00:23:00,440
So why did you bring me here?

377
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:02,799
Didn't you say you wanted to know my past?

378
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:04,279
Yeah.

379
00:23:05,279 --> 00:23:06,440
I wanted to see...

380
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,279
what kind of environment

381
00:23:08,279 --> 00:23:09,960
our bureau's genius grew up in.

382
00:23:14,279 --> 00:23:15,839
Past this alley and around the corner,

383
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:16,880
that's where my old home was.

384
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:19,160
There weren't really streets here back then,

385
00:23:19,359 --> 00:23:20,200
just narrow alleys.

386
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:21,759
Twisting and turning like a maze.

387
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:22,519
That's why...

388
00:23:22,839 --> 00:23:24,480
lots of kids, just like them,

389
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:26,119
would play hide-and-seek together.

390
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:27,599
Hide-and-seek.

391
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:29,680
I liked that, too.

392
00:23:37,799 --> 00:23:40,279
Ever since I was a kid, I wanted to be a cop.

393
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:42,359
So I'll definitely return to the front line,

394
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,279
and risk life and death with you all.

395
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:08,400
You're hurt this badly,

396
00:24:08,799 --> 00:24:09,599
what are you smiling at?

397
00:24:10,799 --> 00:24:11,640
Are you looking at me?

398
00:24:14,319 --> 00:24:15,440
Do you know that

399
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:18,079
when you're focused on work,

400
00:24:19,279 --> 00:24:20,480
you're incredibly attractive?

401
00:24:34,839 --> 00:24:35,200
Let's go.

402
00:24:35,559 --> 00:24:36,440
The boss wants us back.

403
00:24:54,240 --> 00:24:54,640
Captain Bai.

404
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,000
Have a seat.

405
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:12,720
What is it?

406
00:25:17,279 --> 00:25:18,440
I want to tell you a story.

407
00:25:26,559 --> 00:25:27,440
A few years ago,

408
00:25:29,079 --> 00:25:30,319
there was a brother on our squad.

409
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:33,119
I sent him on an undercover mission.

410
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,880
The plan was for him to return after a year.

411
00:25:38,039 --> 00:25:39,200
But he just couldn't

412
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,960
gain the dealer's trust.

413
00:25:42,759 --> 00:25:46,000
So time dragged on.

414
00:25:46,359 --> 00:25:48,359
Year after year.

415
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:50,799
It wasn't until the fourth year

416
00:25:51,119 --> 00:25:52,720
that he finally earned his trust.

417
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,559
But mentally,

418
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:57,160
he was on the verge of a breakdown.

419
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:00,079
Every time I met with him,

420
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:02,000
he would ask me a question.

421
00:26:03,440 --> 00:26:04,119
He would ask,

422
00:26:05,319 --> 00:26:05,920
"Captain,

423
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,720
am I really a cop,

424
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,440
or a drug dealer?"

425
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:24,160
Later, we caught that dealer.

426
00:26:24,559 --> 00:26:26,759
From his confession, we learned

427
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,039
that one night,

428
00:26:31,839 --> 00:26:33,000
our brother

429
00:26:35,799 --> 00:26:37,559
suddenly screamed in his sleep,

430
00:26:39,039 --> 00:26:39,640
"Freeze!

431
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:42,480
Police!"

432
00:26:47,599 --> 00:26:48,200
And so,

433
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,200
he was killed.

434
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:55,440
By the time we found him,

435
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,519
his body had already decomposed.

436
00:26:57,960 --> 00:27:00,720
The dealer had stabbed him 13 times.

437
00:27:22,319 --> 00:27:22,920
Captain,

438
00:27:25,799 --> 00:27:27,079
are you telling me this story

439
00:27:28,599 --> 00:27:30,559
because you have a similar mission for me?

440
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:34,839
Yes.

441
00:27:36,680 --> 00:27:38,200
The provincial department asked us

442
00:27:38,519 --> 00:27:40,079
to dispatch an officer

443
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:42,440
as an undercover operative

444
00:27:43,119 --> 00:27:45,240
to join an Interpol

445
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:47,079
special operation.

446
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:48,799
I recommended you.

447
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,200
I'll go.

448
00:28:02,319 --> 00:28:03,839
Don't rush to answer me.

449
00:28:04,319 --> 00:28:05,920
Going undercover is extremely dangerous.

450
00:28:06,799 --> 00:28:08,319
I want you to think this through.

451
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:11,200
We don't have much time,

452
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,200
but you have ten minutes.

453
00:29:15,559 --> 00:29:17,160
Do you regret switching from CID to narcotics?

454
00:29:22,839 --> 00:29:23,440
No regrets.

455
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:25,839
I think narcotics suits me better than CID.

456
00:29:28,119 --> 00:29:29,359
Drug traffickers are all desperadoes.

457
00:29:30,839 --> 00:29:32,160
Make sure you stay safe.

458
00:30:01,880 --> 00:30:02,279
Captain Bai.

459
00:30:03,319 --> 00:30:04,039
I've made up my mind.

460
00:30:05,119 --> 00:30:05,599
I'll go.

461
00:30:06,400 --> 00:30:09,200
First, I understand how dangerous this mission is.

462
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:10,880
Second,

463
00:30:11,359 --> 00:30:12,200
please trust me.

464
00:30:12,319 --> 00:30:13,839
I'm not the Zhuang Yan I used to be.

465
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:16,319
I believe in myself, too.

466
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:19,119
I will complete the mission successfully.

467
00:30:25,480 --> 00:30:26,920
I only have one requirement for you.

468
00:30:28,799 --> 00:30:30,119
No matter what happens,

469
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:32,839
come back alive.

470
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,480
Let's go.

471
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:43,160
SPECIAL MEETING

472
00:30:59,599 --> 00:31:00,119
Zhuang Yan.

473
00:31:00,559 --> 00:31:01,640
Come, let me introduce everyone.

474
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:04,319
Head of narcotics at Provincial Public Security,

475
00:31:04,319 --> 00:31:05,160
Director Zhou Xianyang.

476
00:31:05,759 --> 00:31:06,440
Hello, Director Zhou.

477
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:07,160
Hello.

478
00:31:07,400 --> 00:31:09,119
I saw him at the last commendation ceremony.

479
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:11,440
This is Interpol

480
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:13,400
Inspector Mai Zhaohui from the Country M Branch.

481
00:31:13,519 --> 00:31:13,880
Hello.

482
00:31:14,039 --> 00:31:14,599
Hello. Nice to meet you.

483
00:31:15,119 --> 00:31:17,039
This is Officer Zhuang Yan from the Narcotics Brigade.

484
00:31:17,319 --> 00:31:17,640
Very good.

485
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,200
Have a seat.

486
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:24,839
Director Zhou.

487
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:26,480
Shall we get started?

488
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:32,359
I'll make this brief.

489
00:31:33,279 --> 00:31:34,400
Earlier this month,

490
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:36,920
we held a special meeting with Interpol

491
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:39,200
to crack down on new drug trafficking

492
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:41,640
syndicates in Jiechan State.

493
00:31:42,240 --> 00:31:46,000
Our department and Interpol Country M branch

494
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:47,400
reached a cooperation agreement.

495
00:31:48,839 --> 00:31:49,640
Early tomorrow morning,

496
00:31:49,839 --> 00:31:53,039
Comrade Zhuang Yan and Inspector Mai Zhaohui

497
00:31:53,039 --> 00:31:53,880
will head to Country M.

498
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:55,599
Comrade Zhuang Yan,

499
00:31:56,119 --> 00:31:58,880
a special mission awaits you.

500
00:31:59,240 --> 00:32:00,440
Zhuang Yan's assignment

501
00:32:00,519 --> 00:32:02,400
is part of Operation Thunderbolt.

502
00:32:03,079 --> 00:32:03,880
This came up suddenly,

503
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,680
so you had little time to prepare mentally.

504
00:32:06,160 --> 00:32:07,319
If you have any questions,

505
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,440
feel free to speak up now.

506
00:32:08,759 --> 00:32:09,920
I obey the organization's orders.

507
00:32:12,200 --> 00:32:14,200
The goal of Operation Thunderbolt

508
00:32:14,240 --> 00:32:16,079
is to use small bait to draw out the big players.

509
00:32:16,799 --> 00:32:18,039
Drug trafficking in Nanhai

510
00:32:18,319 --> 00:32:20,640
is still run by an international cartel.

511
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,880
In Country M, Zhuang Yan

512
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:23,920
will face our old adversary once again.

513
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:25,079
Inspector Mai,

514
00:32:25,119 --> 00:32:26,559
please brief everyone

515
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:28,079
on the latest intelligence you have.

516
00:32:28,079 --> 00:32:28,680
All right.

517
00:32:31,920 --> 00:32:34,519
These are two drug syndicates

518
00:32:34,759 --> 00:32:37,400
operating actively in Southeast Asia.

519
00:32:38,839 --> 00:32:39,599
First, look here.

520
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:41,160
This man is Xiang Dong,

521
00:32:41,559 --> 00:32:43,039
nicknamed Piyazi.

522
00:32:43,039 --> 00:32:45,640
He has his own plantations in Jiechan State,

523
00:32:45,759 --> 00:32:47,279
along with his own private militia.

524
00:32:48,319 --> 00:32:49,319
His younger brother, Xiang Nan,

525
00:32:50,119 --> 00:32:50,960
is mainly responsible for

526
00:32:51,319 --> 00:32:52,960
online drug distribution.

527
00:32:53,799 --> 00:32:54,960
All evidence indicates

528
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:56,759
that behind Piyazi,

529
00:32:57,119 --> 00:32:59,000
lurks the real mastermind.

530
00:32:59,880 --> 00:33:00,680
As for this individual,

531
00:33:01,079 --> 00:33:03,119
we at Interpol

532
00:33:03,519 --> 00:33:04,599
still know nothing about him.

533
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:06,599
However, evidence suggests

534
00:33:07,319 --> 00:33:09,599
that "Mr. Ma" whom you've been investigating,

535
00:33:09,880 --> 00:33:10,640
Ma Jingrong,

536
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:13,400
is a major mainland distributor

537
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:15,599
for the Xiang brothers.

538
00:33:17,519 --> 00:33:19,000
Xiang Dong's brother, Xiang Nan,

539
00:33:19,240 --> 00:33:20,519
was previously seen in Chang'an.

540
00:33:21,599 --> 00:33:24,039
Suspected in a murder case,

541
00:33:24,039 --> 00:33:25,039
he is currently wanted by police.

542
00:33:25,799 --> 00:33:27,279
During his stay in Chang'an,

543
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:30,720
Xiang Nan met with Ma Jingrong and his men.

544
00:33:31,880 --> 00:33:33,359
Ma Jingrong's movements

545
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,559
match Xiang Nan's drug distribution routes

546
00:33:35,559 --> 00:33:37,200
across mainland China.

547
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:39,519
Please look at these photos.

548
00:33:43,119 --> 00:33:44,680
We at Interpol

549
00:33:45,039 --> 00:33:47,400
once hoped to find

550
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:49,200
criminal evidence against the Xiang brothers

551
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:50,480
through Ma Jingrong.

552
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:53,519
But just last month,

553
00:33:54,359 --> 00:33:56,640
Ma Jingrong suddenly appeared in Country M

554
00:33:57,240 --> 00:33:59,279
to meet with drug lord Theerade.

555
00:34:00,039 --> 00:34:01,759
Theerade's public persona, however,

556
00:34:01,759 --> 00:34:03,079
is a businessman in Country M

557
00:34:03,240 --> 00:34:05,480
involved in real estate and tourism.

558
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:07,960
Behind the scenes, though,

559
00:34:08,079 --> 00:34:09,800
he directs his henchman Jiang Liye

560
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:11,440
to run drug trafficking

561
00:34:11,760 --> 00:34:13,440
and syndicate operations.

562
00:34:13,599 --> 00:34:16,159
After meeting with Theerade,

563
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:18,800
Ma Jingrong went to Xilano to see Jiang Liye.

564
00:34:19,039 --> 00:34:21,599
Through a businessman named Qin Mu,

565
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,480
Ma Jingrong had connected with Theerade.

566
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:25,920
Once Ma Jingrong and Jiang Liye reached a deal,

567
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:28,320
Qin Mu decided to team up with Ma Jingrong

568
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:30,199
to muscle into China's drug market.

569
00:34:31,639 --> 00:34:32,679
In other words,

570
00:34:33,119 --> 00:34:34,400
to bring down the Xiang brothers

571
00:34:34,679 --> 00:34:35,920
and Theerade's syndicate,

572
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:37,440
Ma Jingrong is the key.

573
00:34:38,039 --> 00:34:38,440
That's right.

574
00:34:39,880 --> 00:34:41,320
Qin Mu and Ma Jingrong,

575
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:43,480
in order to move the drugs into Jiangyang,

576
00:34:43,679 --> 00:34:46,559
rented a local lumber mill.

577
00:34:47,079 --> 00:34:48,519
However, that mill

578
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:50,519
was already flagged for smuggling national treasures

579
00:34:50,960 --> 00:34:52,920
and watched closely by Country M police.

580
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:55,800
Country M police used those charges

581
00:34:56,239 --> 00:34:57,280
to arrest Ma Jingrong.

582
00:34:57,559 --> 00:34:59,760
Qin Mu and Ma Jingrong's man, Xiao Yunfei,

583
00:34:59,760 --> 00:35:00,800
managed to escape.

584
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:04,119
Ma Jingrong is currently locked up in Xilano Prison.

585
00:35:07,480 --> 00:35:09,719
According to an undercover operative near Qin Mu,

586
00:35:10,280 --> 00:35:12,239
Xiao Yunfei will arrive in Jiangyang within days.

587
00:35:13,519 --> 00:35:16,039
Jiangyang police have already devised an arrest plan.

588
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:18,239
For your cross-border operation,

589
00:35:18,519 --> 00:35:21,320
Zhuang Yan will go undercover into Xilano Prison

590
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:22,480
to make contact with Ma Jingrong.

591
00:35:23,519 --> 00:35:24,000
Chief Zhou,

592
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,480
are Country M police

593
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:27,480
aware of our operation?

594
00:35:27,719 --> 00:35:29,800
We have already reached an agreement

595
00:35:29,800 --> 00:35:32,159
with Country M police for a joint operation.

596
00:35:32,559 --> 00:35:34,599
Country M police will file this

597
00:35:34,840 --> 00:35:37,119
as a classified international joint mission

598
00:35:37,119 --> 00:35:38,280
against narcotics trafficking.

599
00:35:39,639 --> 00:35:41,360
This mission is extremely dangerous,

600
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:44,719
but Inspector Mai Zhaohui and Country M police

601
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:46,599
will do everything to ensure your safety.

602
00:35:47,559 --> 00:35:48,280
Comrade Zhuang Yan,

603
00:35:48,719 --> 00:35:49,679
do you have any further questions?

604
00:35:51,159 --> 00:35:52,000
I have no further questions.

605
00:35:58,119 --> 00:35:59,559
Sir, I have a question.

606
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:02,599
Since I was called to this special meeting,

607
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,639
the leadership must have plans for me.

608
00:36:04,679 --> 00:36:05,840
May I ask what my assignment is?

609
00:36:10,599 --> 00:36:12,280
Good question, Comrade Ge Dan.

610
00:36:13,079 --> 00:36:15,360
The Provincial Department has already

611
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,000
made arrangements for Comrade Ge Dan.

612
00:36:16,119 --> 00:36:17,360
In this special operation,

613
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:20,880
Comrade Ge Dan will enter Country M as a merchant,

614
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:22,559
acting as the liaison between

615
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:24,360
Comrade Zhuang Yan and the department.

616
00:36:24,719 --> 00:36:25,320
Sir.

617
00:36:27,519 --> 00:36:28,639
I request to operate alone.

618
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:33,079
For liaison, I can contact Inspector Mai directly.

619
00:36:33,599 --> 00:36:35,400
Comrade Ge Dan just joined the Narcotics Unit.

620
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:37,280
In terms of both capability and experience,

621
00:36:37,639 --> 00:36:38,400
she falls short.

622
00:36:38,719 --> 00:36:40,280
She isn't the right candidate.

623
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:41,679
That's just your prejudice!

624
00:36:41,920 --> 00:36:43,320
During my time with the Narcotics Brigade,

625
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:45,320
everyone has witnessed my performance!

626
00:36:45,519 --> 00:36:47,480
And in several key operations,

627
00:36:47,639 --> 00:36:49,280
I risked my life just like the senior officers!

628
00:36:50,119 --> 00:36:51,800
Keep your judgments to yourself, Officer Zhuang!

629
00:36:52,199 --> 00:36:54,360
I've partnered with He Bo, Li Xiao,

630
00:36:54,679 --> 00:36:55,400
and Comrade Ge Dan.

631
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,039
Yet out on missions,

632
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:59,159
my coordination with Comrade Ge Dan was the worst.

633
00:36:59,440 --> 00:37:00,760
Therefore, I refuse to partner with her.

634
00:37:01,599 --> 00:37:02,320
Officer Zhuang!

635
00:37:02,719 --> 00:37:04,239
Drop your prejudice and arbitrary judgment!

636
00:37:04,519 --> 00:37:05,960
This was approved by the Provincial Department.

637
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:07,239
Respect the leadership's decision!

638
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,320
Both of you, sit down.

639
00:37:21,760 --> 00:37:23,519
Officer Ge's trip to Country M

640
00:37:23,639 --> 00:37:26,400
is mainly for liaison duties.

641
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:28,440
The operational risk is very low.

642
00:37:28,719 --> 00:37:30,119
Furthermore, we at Interpol

643
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:31,480
will protect both of you.

644
00:37:39,599 --> 00:37:41,360
The Jiangyang Border Narcotics Brigade

645
00:37:41,559 --> 00:37:43,079
will monitor your status at all times.

646
00:37:43,760 --> 00:37:45,280
If anything goes wrong,

647
00:37:45,679 --> 00:37:47,559
they'll back you up immediately.

648
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:48,480
Officer Zhuang,

649
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:51,119
I admire your desire to protect your colleague,

650
00:37:52,039 --> 00:37:53,000
but I need you

651
00:37:53,199 --> 00:37:54,880
to consider the bigger picture.

652
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:56,119
Don't let emotions cloud your judgment.

653
00:37:56,519 --> 00:37:58,480
Officer Ge Dan's role in this special operation

654
00:37:58,480 --> 00:38:00,280
is strictly to serve as a liaison.

655
00:38:03,599 --> 00:38:04,119
Director Huang,

656
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:07,079
why don't we give these two officers

657
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,960
some time alone?

658
00:38:09,719 --> 00:38:11,320
After all, on an overseas mission,

659
00:38:11,639 --> 00:38:12,840
they must coordinate closely.

660
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:29,159
Here.

661
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:29,880
Thank you.

662
00:38:31,159 --> 00:38:31,679
Captain Bai,

663
00:38:33,039 --> 00:38:33,920
you called me over.

664
00:38:34,159 --> 00:38:36,519
Are you concerned about Officer Zhuang's actions?

665
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:40,119
As Zhuang Yan's direct superior,

666
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:42,039
in his ability to accomplish the mission,

667
00:38:42,239 --> 00:38:43,320
I have complete faith.

668
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:46,159
However, regarding the mission this time,

669
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,679
I do have some questions.

670
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:50,239
I hope you can do your best

671
00:38:50,239 --> 00:38:50,960
to answer them for me.

672
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:52,320
Go ahead.

673
00:38:54,079 --> 00:38:55,119
First, I'd like to know:

674
00:38:55,880 --> 00:38:57,880
If Zhuang Yan, during the mission,

675
00:38:57,880 --> 00:38:58,639
meets with an accident,

676
00:38:59,719 --> 00:39:01,840
will Interpol officially

677
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:02,840
launch a rescue?

678
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:06,679
As for this question...

679
00:39:06,960 --> 00:39:08,280
We at Interpol

680
00:39:08,639 --> 00:39:09,960
are merely a coordinating agency.

681
00:39:10,559 --> 00:39:12,719
In international criminal cooperation,

682
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:14,960
our authority cannot infringe upon

683
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:16,320
the judicial sovereignty of any nation.

684
00:39:17,599 --> 00:39:19,320
Nor do we have the right in Country M

685
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:22,119
to conduct investigations, arrests, or surveillance.

686
00:39:22,159 --> 00:39:23,119
Captain Bai,

687
00:39:23,519 --> 00:39:24,840
don't misunderstand our roles.

688
00:39:27,639 --> 00:39:28,400
Zhuang Yan...

689
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:30,320
His direct command lies with the Chinese police.

690
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:31,599
Interpol, on the other hand,

691
00:39:31,599 --> 00:39:33,440
can only provide assistance at most.

692
00:39:36,559 --> 00:39:39,039
With command lying on our side,

693
00:39:39,039 --> 00:39:40,119
does that mean

694
00:39:40,280 --> 00:39:42,199
the support Country M's police can provide

695
00:39:42,559 --> 00:39:43,400
is limited?

696
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:46,320
Normally, just like us,

697
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:49,639
you have no law enforcement authority in Country M.

698
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:52,519
Given the unique and dangerous nature of this mission,

699
00:39:53,679 --> 00:39:55,400
Country M's police will grant you

700
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:56,840
the maximum operational clearance.

701
00:39:57,920 --> 00:39:59,400
If he, under the guise of an inmate,

702
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,880
is arrested by Country M's police,

703
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:02,239
what will happen?

704
00:40:04,639 --> 00:40:06,239
Even without me saying it,

705
00:40:06,239 --> 00:40:07,639
you already know the answer.

706
00:40:08,400 --> 00:40:09,719
If anything happens

707
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:10,639
to Zhuang Yan in Country M,

708
00:40:10,639 --> 00:40:12,320
we will not stand idly by.

709
00:40:13,639 --> 00:40:14,119
Of course.

710
00:40:16,519 --> 00:40:17,599
Zhuang Yan's new identity...

711
00:40:18,400 --> 00:40:18,960
What is it?

712
00:40:19,599 --> 00:40:20,840
Chinese businessman Zhuang Cen.

713
00:40:21,039 --> 00:40:22,039
English name: Michael.

714
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:25,920
One last question,

715
00:40:26,719 --> 00:40:28,119
and a favor to ask of you.

716
00:40:32,559 --> 00:40:34,480
The first stop of his undercover mission

717
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:35,800
is Xilano Prison.

718
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:37,199
It's an isolated place.

719
00:40:37,599 --> 00:40:39,360
We may have no way of contacting him.

720
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:41,119
I believe even with your position,

721
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:43,880
there will be many constraints.

722
00:40:44,639 --> 00:40:45,440
Yet I know

723
00:40:45,679 --> 00:40:46,719
you must have a way

724
00:40:47,360 --> 00:40:48,599
to assist him.

725
00:40:54,199 --> 00:40:54,639
All right.

726
00:40:55,760 --> 00:40:56,960
I'll find him a partner.

727
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,239
However, this partner

728
00:40:58,639 --> 00:40:59,960
has no ties

729
00:41:00,039 --> 00:41:00,960
to Interpol whatsoever.

730
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:01,440
Is that acceptable?

731
00:41:02,880 --> 00:41:03,320
Understood.

732
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:07,840
For their overseas mission,

733
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,880
please help them as much as you can, Inspector Mai.

734
00:41:10,280 --> 00:41:11,280
After all, to me,

735
00:41:11,599 --> 00:41:13,239
their safety is what matters most.

736
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:14,400
Don't worry.

737
00:41:14,960 --> 00:41:15,599
Thank you.

738
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:17,280
You're welcome.

739
00:41:28,400 --> 00:41:29,360
When I was seven,

740
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,840
I had a very close friend.

741
00:41:32,719 --> 00:41:34,119
We were playing hide-and-seek.

742
00:41:34,519 --> 00:41:36,239
She followed me into an old courtyard,

743
00:41:36,280 --> 00:41:37,119
but as it happened,

744
00:41:38,039 --> 00:41:39,639
a fugitive was hiding there, too.

745
00:41:43,079 --> 00:41:45,440
I watched helplessly as she got hurt.

746
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:52,960
That's why,

747
00:41:54,000 --> 00:41:55,199
on every single mission,

748
00:41:57,199 --> 00:41:58,400
I never want you to get hurt.

749
00:42:00,880 --> 00:42:01,679
Listen to me.

750
00:42:02,119 --> 00:42:02,599
Don't go.

751
00:42:03,760 --> 00:42:05,119
I know you mean well,

752
00:42:05,360 --> 00:42:06,239
but I can't accept that.

753
00:42:07,599 --> 00:42:09,000
I have to go with you.

754
00:42:13,519 --> 00:42:15,079
Do you even understand?

755
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:17,119
Once our cover is blown,

756
00:42:17,599 --> 00:42:19,079
we might not make it back.

757
00:42:19,639 --> 00:42:20,320
I do understand.

758
00:42:21,360 --> 00:42:22,559
It's precisely because it's so dangerous

759
00:42:22,719 --> 00:42:24,320
that I can't let you take this risk alone.

760
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:34,920
I know you care about me,

761
00:42:36,840 --> 00:42:38,000
and I want you to understand...

762
00:42:40,039 --> 00:42:40,440
I...

763
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:46,400
We're partners.

764
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:51,719
Partners should protect each other

765
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:52,840
and watch each other's backs.

766
00:42:54,039 --> 00:42:54,760
When danger strikes,

767
00:42:55,239 --> 00:42:56,800
why can't we face it together?

768
00:42:57,679 --> 00:42:59,000
Besides, on an undercover mission,

769
00:43:00,559 --> 00:43:02,079
I don't want your inner loneliness

770
00:43:02,079 --> 00:43:02,920
to make you lose yourself.

771
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:06,280
I want to go with you.

772
00:43:07,000 --> 00:43:07,880
With me by your side,

773
00:43:09,039 --> 00:43:10,199
at least you won't be alone.
